Third-party data
  Food composition data: Tabel Komposisi Pangan Indonesia (TKPI) 2019,
  Kementerian Kesehatan Republik Indonesia (https://panganku.org,
  https://repository.kemkes.go.id). Values were collected from the public
  TKPI listing; see scripts/scrape-tkpi2019.py.

  Exercise energy values: MET values adapted (rounded) from the Compendium of
